name: Scary Face — face-card chips
author: corpus
description: >-
  Scary Face gives played face cards +30 Chips when scored. First-shop chip engine:
  Pareidolia makes every card a face card so all scored cards get +30. Avoid the
  Abandoned Deck (no face cards).
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - joker: ScaryFace
    antes: [1]
    sources:
      shopItems: [0, 1, 2, 3]
      boosterPacks: [0, 1]
should:
  - joker: Pareidolia
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 45
  - joker: SockAndBuskin
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 25
